///  * [selectAll], which selects the entire content.␀␀␀À␀ñVÀ␀ñVÀ␀ñf␀␀␀À␀ñrÀ␀ñrÀ␀ñw␀␀␀À␀ñÀ␀ñ À␀ñ ␀À␀ñ„À␀ë1À␀ë1‡ïÀ␀ñA…Î/// Sets or updates selection start edge to the `offset` location.
